  "body": "Throw open the doors, gather your friends and enjoy your own leafy escape-this freestanding Orakei home makes indoor-outdoor living the main event.\r\n\r\n* Expansive deck framed by lush greenery-an inviting setting for summer lunches, evening drinks and relaxed entertaining.\r\n* Open-plan kitchen, living and dining with multiple openings to the deck.\r\n* Privately positioned at the end of a right of way.\r\n* Flexible accommodation over two levels, including a downstairs bedroom and bathroom for guests or working from home.\r\n* Upstairs master with ensuite, lofty ceilings, three bathrooms overall and a separate WC.\r\n* In zone for Selwyn College and Baradene College.\r\n\r\n-information pack: https://tinyurl.com/29b-rukutai \r\n\r\nCome home, open the doors and let the day unwind. Whether you are hosting a lively gathering or enjoying a quiet coffee surrounded by greenery, the connection between indoors and out gives this home its irresistible appeal.\r\n\r\nBeyond your private retreat, enjoy a location that brings everyday essentials and weekend favourites close together. Patteson Reserve is approx. 400m away, with shopping and dining at Eastridge Shopping Centre approx. 800m away. Meet friends at Mission Bay's cafes or stroll along the beach, approx. 1.5km away. Orakei train station is approx. 2km away.\r\n\r\nSpace to gather, room for flexibility and the best of the Bays within easy reach - come and discover it for yourself.\r\n\r\nCurrently tenanted on a periodic tenancy.  Viewing by appointment.\r\n\r\nContact Roman Hu at 021 590 027 for viewing.  Conjunctional sales are welcome.\r\n\r\n-Some photos are from a previous listing. Current property condition may vary.",
